1.YONO SBI app open pannunga.
2.Ungaloda SBI Internet Banking/YONO credentials use panni login pannunga.
3.Deposits section-ku ponga.
4.Recurring Deposit / e-RD option select pannunga.
5.Start New Recurring Deposit select pannunga.
6.Endha SBI Savings Account-la irundhu monthly amount debit aaganum nu account select pannunga.
7.Monthly RD amount enter pannunga — example ₹1,000.
8.RD tenure select pannunga — example 12 months / 24 months / 36 months.
9.Monthly instalment debit date select pannunga.
10.Details ellam once review pannunga.
11.Terms & conditions accept panni Confirm pannunga.
12.Confirmation vandha udane RD account create aagidum. SBI e-RD facility-ku Internet Banking username/password + mapped transaction account irukkanum.
